{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a971b744a191ec6a","name":"The Disciples of Ragnos","source":{"id":"source:reference-a971b744a191ec6a","title":"The Disciples of Ragnos","revision":18899,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:56:36Z","sha256":"3d2ceac7abafc0944dca25d3e9dc7fd06c82302c79b161930a277da13064f5e5","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18899","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Disciples%20of%20Ragnos&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a971b744a191ec6a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Those ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reborn"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reborn","referenceId":"reference:388c9225a0d44757"}," who survived the assault by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kyle Katarn"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kyle_Katarn","referenceId":"reference:71f9e86450d44ffa"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rogue Squadron"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rogue_Squadron","referenceId":"reference:e6e2c9567a6f5c6f"}," assembled under the leadership of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tavion Axmis"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tavion_Axmis?action=edit&redlink=1"},", Desann's apprentice. With the assistance of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},", Tavion created a Sith cult called The Disciples of Ragnos and named it the New Reborn. Striving to continue Desann's work, the cultists eventually made their way to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Korriban"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Korriban","referenceId":"reference:e5de27f696051005"},", where they were defeated within the ancient Sith tombs in the Valley of the Dark Lords by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jaden Korr"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jaden_Korr?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and a band of Jedi from Skywalker's academy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Reborn"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Reborn","referenceId":"reference:e5c5d6c6c0f495f1"}," are easily recognized by their orange cloaks and simple, red-bladed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},". Even though they have been granted the ability to use ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", their aptitude to wield it is not very strong, but their ability with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," compensates for this shortcoming.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Disciples of Ragnos Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Nonheroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reborn"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reborn","referenceId":"reference:388c9225a0d44757"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"br","children":[]},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
